name: boundary
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: false
note: fires when two sets that must move together drift — here, the
  raylib/kjs facet's preventDefault key set vs the keys games actually bind.
  Adding Enter-as-restart to asteroids without extending the facet guard let
  a game key reach the browser default (activate focused link → navigate
  away mid-game). The boundary is: every key a game may bind must be in the
  facet's capture set, or the host page owns it.
